<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 610 0 R
/E (Small, multi-site clinical data : ABIDE combines scans from multiple sites and scanners with limited subject counts, which increases the risk of overfitting and of site-related variation being mistaken for diagnostic signal)
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
