/P 611 0 R
/E (Unclear benefit of graph structure : Prior work \(El Gazzar et al.\) shows GNNs do not consistently outperform simpler, structure-agnostic baselines, leaving open the question of how much the graph structure itself contributes)
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
