281 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 156 0 R
/E ( FBNetGen was implemented as an end-to-end, task-aware alternative to fixed-graph construction. Instead of starting from a pre-computed correlation matrix, the framework learns the brain network structure directly from raw fMRI time-series data. The graph generation step is optimized jointly with the downstream classification objective, meaning the resulting adjacency matrix is shaped by what is actually predictive of ASD versus HC, rather than fixed in advance by a statistical rule.)
/Pg 19 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
